    "description": "Nature\nNatural Mineral and Fossil Collection\nAmethyst, Quartz, Geode, Coral, Selenite\n9\" x 7\" x 5\" Overall\nUnsigned\nThis diverse collection of natural mineral and fossil specimens features a variety of geological formations, ranging from crystalline clusters to fossilized marine life. The centerpiece of the lot is a significant Amethyst slice heavily included with metallic Pyrite, showcasing a striking contrast between the purple druzy and the golden mineral deposits. The set also includes two distinct Brain Coral fossils, exhibiting the intricate labyrinthine patterns characteristic of these ancient marine organisms.\nDiverse assortment including clear Quartz clusters, a split crystal geode, and Selenite wands\nVariety of tumbled and raw stones such as Rose Quartz, Green Calcite, and Jasper\nTotal weight of collection is 7 pounds; specimens sized for tabletop display\nCondition:\nSpecimens are in good natural condition with characteristic geological textures and structures. The quartz crystals are largely intact with minor natural termination wear. The brain coral fossils are stable and well-preserved. Minor natural fracturing and surface variation are present as is typical for unpolished raw minerals.\nWarehouse Location: Cleveland\nDue to our lighting, white glare lines may appear on items - This is NOT damage\nIf you have any questions regarding the quality or authenticity of this item or general questions regarding and item, please click Contact Seller on the item page and send us a message. We are available to answer your questions Monday through Friday, 8 am - 3:00 pm, EST.\n* For combined shipping policy see the shipping tab.\nSome items may contain unseen flaws not noted in the description.\nSee Photos. Items sold as-is.",
